 nts:\nTuesday\, November 10\, 2026\n6:00 P.M. -Dinner Theater- “The Prom
 ise”/Revolutionary Conversation\nOrangeburg District African American Pa
 triots\nClaflin University Student Center\n1810 Magnolia Street\, Orangebu
 rg\, SC 29115\nLimited Seating- RSVP Now! \nWednesday\, November 11\, 2026
