BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Carolinas Revolutionary War Weekend and Reenactments
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261113
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261116
UID:10003137-1794528000-1794787199@southcarolina250.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://southcarolina250.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2026/08/Rev-War-Reenactment-2024-LQ-scaled.jpg
CATEGORIES:Demonstrations - Reenactments,Events,Exhibits,Performance
DESCRIPTION:The Souths largest Annual Revolutionary War Reenactment and th
 e largest Force on Force event in the nation. \nThis event has been a four
 -time National Revolutionary War Reenactment event. It will take place in 
 Kershaw County on November 14-15\, with November 13 being the free Educati
 on Day for registered students. This year the Battles of Hanging Rock and 
 as always\, the Battle of Camden will be fought. \nThere will be period me
 rchants\, demonstrators\, and military encampments on a location that puts
  you in the 18th Century. \nThere will be food truck available. \nFor tick
 eting information\, click here. \nTo register for Education Day\, click he
 re. \nTo learn more and see a detailed schedule of events\, go to our webs
 ite: Southern Campaign 1780. \nHuzzah!
LOCATION:The Meeting Place\, 1208 Keys Lane\, Kershaw\, SC\, 29067\, Unite
 d States
URL:https://southcarolina250.com/event/carolinas-revolutionary-war-weekend
 -and-reenactments/
END:VEVENT
