 a special pre-show lecture from lauded historians exploring the history\, 
 myths\, and realities of the American Revolution. A perfect evening for mo
 vie lovers and history enthusiasts alike. \nReservations are required as s
 pace is limited. https://artscenterkc.org/ac/the-patriot/ \nPlease be awar
 e that seating is first-come\, first-served. \nPresented through special a
