 026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-01-152859.png
CATEGORIES:Lectures,Other
DESCRIPTION:November 20 – South Carolina’s Revolutionary Leaders. \nCo
 me and learn about some of South Carolina’s Revolutionary Leaders such a
 s Robert Anderson\, Andrew Pickens\, Henry Laurens\, Thomas Sumter\, Franc
 is Marion\, Thomas Heyward\, Jr.\, Arthur Middleton\, and others. \nAs a p
 art of our celebrations and remembrances during the 250th\, the Anderson C
 ounty Museum is adding a series to our Homeschool Friday program. \nThe Re
 volutionary War Review series will focus on several elements of the Revolu
 tionary War and is open to all students.
