BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Remember the Ladies: Backcountry
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T120000
UID:10003174-1795255200-1795262400@southcarolina250.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://southcarolina250.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2026/08/Ladies-11.21.jpg
CATEGORIES:Events
DESCRIPTION:Spend your morning with some of the Patriot ladies of South C
 arolina’s backcountry.\nProgram Highlights: \n\nColonel Rawdon\, Command
 er of the Camden Garrison\, will spar with Mrs. Sarah McCalla over her hus
 band being held as a POW.\nPaul Wood will speak on Dicey Langston and her 
 Revolutionary legacy.\nBettise Davidson will tell the story of the Widow J
 enkins of Marion District who defied a British officer.\n\nLight refreshme
 nts will be served. \n*After our program\, visitors are encouraged to visi
 t Historic Camden for a “Make & Take” craft for the ladies.*
LOCATION:Revolutionary War Visitor Center\, 212 Broad Street\, Camden\, SC
 \, 29020\, United States
URL:https://southcarolina250.com/event/remember-the-ladies-backcountry/
END:VEVENT
